keywords:
  - Sanger sequencing
  - variant calling
  - genomic variant analysis
  - molecular genetics
  - bioinformatics
  - HGVS
  - Ensembl VEP
  - prostate cancer

abstract: >
  A reproducible Python pipeline for processing targeted Sanger
  sequencing chromatograms, identifying high-confidence variants,
  generating HGVS representations, annotating variants, and performing
  case-control association and Hardy-Weinberg equilibrium analyses.
